T-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">사업명 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">: <span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">2016 선정 연구마을지원사업 추가과제</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\"><o:p></o:p></span>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">지원기관 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">: </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">중소벤처기업부</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\"><o:p></o:p></span>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">지원대상 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">: </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">연구마을에 기업부설연구소를 설치</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">/</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">이전하고 대학과 공동기술개발을 통해</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\"><o:p></o:p></span>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">연구개발 및 기술혁신 역량 강화를 희망하는 중소기업</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\"><o:p></o:p></span>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">라</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">정부출연금 및 지원기간 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">: </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">총사업비의 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">75%</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">이내</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">,&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">1</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">년 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">1</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">억 지원</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\"><o:p></o:p></span>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><strong><font color=\"#cc3d3d\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">마</span></spa